  @case 'an unnamed slot seeds pinned, and names no base'  [harness]  @ 479-490
  @case 'an ambiguous base pins every slot carrying it, and still stands in the list'  [harness]  @ 494-509
  @case 'audio slots take no part, so an audio namesake leaves a base unambiguous'  [harness]  @ 513-527
