  @case 'createAndDropMidi returns nil when no track exists'  [harness]  @ 771-776
  @case 'keyForSlot maps 0..61 through util.toBase62'  [harness]  @ 783-792
  @case 'takesUsing scans each take swing map (ds) for the named swing'  [harness]  @ 799-817
  @case 'tempersInUse unions take/project temper names, minus the 12EDO floor'  [harness]  @ 820-834
